description	"N5 Sentry Droid aka New Republic Security Droid

Patrol units with reinforced armor, equipped to subdue unruly prisoners with standard weaponry and built-in magnetic devices.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee (Wookiee-style)
-- 40% slower RoF
-- Heavyweight
-- Punch/grab only
- Stun Baton (Purple Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Shocks on hit
-- 40% shorter
-- 166% thicker
-- Primary fire only
- Modified DH-17 (A280) (2)
- Magnetic Attractor Device (MG) (2)
-- 96% less damage
-- 90% slower RoF
-- 60% more velocity
-- Pulls on hit
- Minature Magnetic Trap Mines (3)
-- 50% less damage
-- Pulls/disarms on det

^5Powers:
- Magnetic (Force) Pull ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Strength (3)
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Magnetic Plating
- Beskar (1)
- Blast Armor
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Shoulder Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS2]"